{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918930/extras/fbe699386d362d14aa3e9a419e1adff3.poster.avif?t=1773158275\" width=1170 height=562 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918930/extras/fbe699386d362d14aa3e9a419e1adff3.webm?t=1773158275\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918930/extras/fbe699386d362d14aa3e9a419e1adff3.mp4?t=1773158275\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Foreverthorn</strong> is a short FPS game about facing your grief after the death of your wife. It will take you deep into the dungeons of Rose Chapel to <strong>find roses for her grave. </strong>Enveloped by thorns, the dungeons are filled with grim\u00a0 monsters-- use your <strong>shotgun</strong> to destroy them or simply kick them out of the way.    <br>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918930/extras/1b41a5da9983d172f6cd34d111644623.poster.avif?t=1773158275\" width=1170 height=562 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918930/extras/1b41a5da9983d172f6cd34d111644623.webm?t=1773158275\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918930/extras/1b41a5da9983d172f6cd34d111644623.mp4?t=1773158275\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the environment, discover the secrets of this eerie and dark place and look for useful items like health and ammo, all while avoiding death.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918930/extras/f238fd2a42e98592ba15428b8ecae665.avif?t=1773158275\" width=1560 height=504 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A labyrinthine dungeon environment </strong>with multiple levels, wrapped in a dark and eerie atmosphere.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FPS gameplay</strong>\u00a0where danger lurks behind every corner.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stylized 3D pixelated graphics.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Relatively short playtime of about one hour.</strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3918930?t=1773158275","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918930/f5630d41d6f3904ae6f0dbba277079538fc4411e/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1773158275","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918930/189ec74c1b0d9b229ca1e34c27158fb1cde9961c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773158275","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918930/189ec74c1b0d9b229ca1e34c27158fb1cde9961c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773158275","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"The game includes blood and themes like death and grief, which may be unpleasant to some players."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918930/extras/fbe699386d362d14aa3e9a419e1adff3.poster.avif?t=1773158275\" width=1170 height=562 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918930/extras/fbe699386d362d14aa3e9a419e1adff3.webm?t=1773158275\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_a